<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  Klinik.Net wordmark + mark, converted from prototype/assets/logo.svg.

  The wordmark is baked to outlines from Plus Jakarta Sans ExtraBold
  (SIL OFL 1.1) in the source SVG: cap height 22.71px, baseline 39.4,
  tracking -0.8px. Every path is carried across byte for byte; nothing was
  retyped. The per-path SVG transform became an equivalent group, and a group
  applies scale before translate, which is the same composition order the SVG
  transform list expresses.

  Viewport 200x56 matches the SVG, so the drawable sizes itself exactly as the
  lockup does in the prototype.

  Glyph is lucide "car-front" (ISC). See NOTICE for attribution.
-->
